                                <div class="card bg-light mb-3">
                                    <div class="card-body">
                                        <h5><span class="badge bg-warning text-dark me-2">STEP 3</span> <i class="fas fa-key text-warning me-2"></i> Get Your Connection Details</h5>
                                        <ol>
                                            <li>When the service is ready, click on it</li>
                                            <li>Go to the <strong>"Connection Information"</strong> tab</li>
                                            <li>
                                                You'll see:
                                                <ul>
                                                    <li><strong>Host:</strong> Like "your-database.aivencloud.com"</li>
                                                    <li><strong>Port:</strong> Usually 5432</li>
                                                    <li><strong>Database Name:</strong> "defaultdb"</li>
                                                    <li><strong>Username:</strong> "avnadmin"</li>
                                                    <li><strong>Password:</strong> (the one you set)</li>
                                                </ul>
                                            </li>
                                            <li>Click <strong>"Download CA Certificate"</strong> for security</li>
                                        </ol>
