                                            <li>Open <strong>SSMS</strong> (SQL Server Management Studio)</li>
                                            <li>In the Server Name field, enter your <strong>Host</strong> from Aiven</li>
                                            <li>Select <strong>"SQL Server Authentication"</strong></li>
                                            <li>Enter <strong>Username</strong> and <strong>Password</strong> from Aiven</li>
                                            <li>Click <strong>Connect</strong></li>
                                        </ol>
                                        <div class="code-block small">
                                            <pre><code class="language-sql"><span class="comment">/* Connection Example */</span>
<span style="color: #82aaff;">Server:</span> <span style="color: #c3e88d;">my-database.aivencloud.com</span>
<span style="color: #82aaff;">Port:</span> <span style="color: #f78c6c;">5432</span>
<span style="color: #82aaff;">Authentication:</span> <span style="color: #c3e88d;">SQL Server Authentication</span>
<span style="color: #82aaff;">Username:</span> <span style="color: #c3e88d;">avnadmin</span>
<span style="color: #82aaff;">Password:</span> <span style="color: #c3e88d;">YourPassword</span></code></pre>
