                                                <div class="code-block small">
                                                    <pre><code class="language-csharp"><span class="comment">// Your Connection String</span>
<span style="color: #c3e88d;">"Server=my-database.aivencloud.com,5432;"</span> +
<span style="color: #c3e88d;">"Database=defaultdb;"</span> +
<span style="color: #c3e88d;">"User Id=avnadmin;"</span> +
<span style="color: #c3e88d;">"Password=YourPassword;"</span> +
<span style="color: #c3e88d;">"TrustServerCertificate=True;"</span> +
<span style="color: #c3e88d;">"Encrypt=True;"</span></code></pre>
                                                </div>
                                                <p><span class="badge bg-primary">📌</span> Keep this string - you'll use it in every C# project!</p>
                                            </div>
                                        </div>
