                                                    <li>Open your C# project in Visual Studio</li>
                                                    <li>Go to <strong>Tools → Connect to Database</strong></li>
                                                    <li>Select <strong>Microsoft SQL Server</strong></li>
                                                    <li>Paste your connection string</li>
                                                    <li>Test the connection</li>
                                                    <li>✅ Connected!</li>
