                                                <div class="card bg-success text-white mt-2">
                                                    <div class="card-body">
                                                        <i class="fas fa-check-circle me-2"></i>
                                                        <strong>🎉 You're ready!</strong> You can now use this database in your C# apps!
                                                    </div>
                                                </div>
                                            </div>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                </div>

                                <div class="card bg-warning text-dark mt-3">
                                    <div class="card-body">
                                        <i class="fas fa-lightbulb me-2"></i>
                                        <strong>💡 Pro Tip:</strong> Store your connection string in <code>appsettings.json</code>
                                        or <code>App.config</code> so you can change it easily!
